Package: ZetaHTE
Type: Package
Title: Zero and Tail Treatment Effect Heterogeneity Test
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Miles", "Xi", email = "nxi@ucla.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements the ZETA test for treatment effect
    heterogeneity with a semicontinuous biomarker. Combines zero mass and
    positive tail channels using a residual wild bootstrap, and provides
    descriptive interpretation after a significant global test.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/xnnba1984/ZetaHTE
BugReports: https://github.com/xnnba1984/ZetaHTE/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, graphics, grDevices
NeedsCompilation: no
